# Sensitive Bridge v1.4 Lexicon Citation

## Required YAML Fields

Every lexicon YAML file must include:

- `status`
- `source.citation`
- `source.link`
- `detector_patterns`

## Review Status

`status: scaffolded_unreviewed` files must never load in production. `lexicon_loader.py` must filter them out.

## Verbatim Patterns

If any pattern has `verbatim: true`, that pattern must include its own citation and link. APA-style citation belongs in `source.citation`.

## Placement

Addiction lexicons live under `backend/data/lexicons/addiction/`. Trafficking lexicons live under `backend/data/lexicons/polyvictimization/trafficking/`.
